# Backend REST API Base URL
# - In Local Development with Vite Dev Proxy: /api (proxies to http://127.0.0.1:5000)
# - In Local Development Direct: http://localhost:5000/api
# - In Production (Split Deployment on Vercel): https://your-backend.onrender.com/api
# - In Production (Unified Deployment on Render): /api
VITE_API_URL=/api
